 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"What do you make of all this? Really. I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"What's this about? Bleak. Probably true. I keep looking for the part where it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Watch for this: It drops its head and paws the earth — once, twice — and the dust comes up in a wall. Dustboar, every time. It hunts by day — watch the open ground.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"It crouches low, tail lashing once, twice. That's The Mountain Lord telling you it's about to move. Dawn and dusk, that's when it's out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Still on what you make of all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"That's enough for now. It'll percolate.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Well — Where are you from — originally? Before all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Nods slowly. \"Columbus, Ohio. I'll remember that. Everybody's from somewhere that isn't here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Quick update — Me? Tokyo, Japan. I still dream in its weather — rain on a tin roof, that specific smell. I wake up here and for a second I'm furious at the sky for the swap.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They go very still. Not relaxed-still. Held-still."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"You think you know me?\" Yasuko steps closer. \"You don't. Back off.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Hannah doesn't wait for an answer. \"We need to discuss how things are run here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "*Last time, they came at you for asking. That's not innocence talking. Hold your ground.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Okay.\" Hannah looks down. \"Okay. It was me. 1× Stone — I was hungry and I... I'm sorry.\" Their voice is small."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"The pantry's nearly bare. Forage with me tomorrow? I know where the prickly pear grows thick.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Another day like today and we're choosing who eats. Nobody's worked where the prickly pear grows thick in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling Flashbulb Moth? Peyton is pushing 'Ugly-Eyes'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Yasuko sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "A flicker at the corner of their mouth. Not quite a smile. Not quite anything."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "*You know the counter-attack now — the anger IS the tell. It means the accusation landed. Don't flinch.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Oh.\" A long pause. \"I didn't think it was anyone's. It's gone — I ate it days ago. I'm sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Okay, real question: what's the funniest thing you've seen since we got here? I desperately need it. Funny how that works.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They laugh — really laugh, the first real one you've heard in days. \"Okay. Okay, that's good. I needed that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Still on the funniest thing you've seen.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Well. My social battery is officially dead.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You called this the end of the world. We're still here, though. That's either something, or it's us.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Cooking With Teeth. They just... took Tom. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Same as always: we endure.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You show them Lamb's Quarters — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Have you ever hurt someone? Since all this started.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They nod, slow. \"Okay. Thank you for telling me. That couldn't have been easy to say.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I don't keep score on that. Score-keeping is how you stop sleeping. I do what the day needs and I don't rehearse it after.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on whether you've hurt someone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "*Last time, they came at you for asking. That's not innocence talking. Hold your ground.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I don't actually want to belong somewhere. I want to prove they're useful. I weighed the lie against what the truth would cost them. The lie was cheaper.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Peyton sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Peyton rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You told me you're from Columbus, Ohio. Do you think about it much?"
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them Common Plantain — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Got a read on anyone here yet? Who should I be watching? Extremely normal, all of it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Same. But keep your eyes open — some people here are performing, not surviving.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Watch the quiet ones. Not the loud — the loud tell you everything. The quiet are either thinking or planning, and you can't tell which until it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on your read on people here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? We all learn.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Hardened Cooking With Teeth. They just... took Daniyar. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Ask me tomorrow. Everything changes by tomorrow.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"We'll see what the treeline brings. We always do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them Lamb's Quarters — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
